        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The sword arts, drilled rather than intuited. You gain access to the <strong>Zanjutsu</strong> feat family and <strong>one Zanjutsu technique</strong> of your choice for free.</p><p>Zanjutsu techniques are Strike-based reiatsu effects, each costing 1 Reiatsu Point and requiring your spirit weapon to be Released.</p><hr /><p><em>The Zanjutsu techniques themselves arrive with the class feats. Until then this grants the access and nothing else &mdash; it is not hiding a grant that failed.</em></p>"
